{"id": "wwdc2019-805", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2019/805", "wordCount": 2014, "segments": [{"start": 11.0, "text": "Hello. My name is Ian and I"}, {"start": 14.0, "text": "am an engineer on the Shortcuts"}, {"start": 15.0, "text": "Team."}, {"start": 16.0, "text": "Today I'm going to talk to you"}, {"start": 18.0, "text": "about how users can build their"}, {"start": 19.0, "text": "own shortcuts and how you can"}, {"start": 21.0, "text": "ensure that they have the best"}, {"start": 22.0, "text": "possible experience."}, {"start": 24.0, "text": "I'm going to cover three topics"}, {"start": 27.0, "text": "today."}, {"start": 28.0, "text": "First, intents from your app can"}, {"start": 30.0, "text": "now be editable by the user as"}, {"start": 31.0, "text": "actions."}, {"start": 32.0, "text": "I'm going to walk you through"}, {"start": 34.0, "text": "the parts of an action and show"}, {"start": 35.0, "text": "how users can configure them"}, {"start": 37.0, "text": "inside of their Shortcuts."}, {"start": 39.0, "text": "You've built great Shortcuts and"}, {"start": 41.0, "text": "we want to make sure that you"}, {"start": 42.0, "text": "can get them in front of your"}, {"start": 43.0, "text": "users, as well."}, {"start": 44.0, "text": "I'm going to talk about some"}, {"start": 45.0, "text": "ways that you can showcase the"}, {"start": 47.0, "text": "Shortcuts from your app using"}, {"start": 48.0, "text": "Add to Siri and other APIs."}, {"start": 51.0, "text": "And later on, we're going to"}, {"start": 53.0, "text": "build a multistep shortcut and"}, {"start": 55.0, "text": "make actions that work great"}, {"start": 56.0, "text": "with others by using input and"}, {"start": 58.0, "text": "output."}, {"start": 59.0, "text": "Let's get started."}, {"start": 62.0, "text": "I have an app called Soup Chef."}, {"start": 63.0, "text": "And as you know, it's a super"}, {"start": 65.0, "text": "way to order clam chowder or"}, {"start": 67.0, "text": "tomato soup for delivery and"}, {"start": 69.0, "text": "pickup."}, {"start": 70.0, "text": "And Soup Chef has made an intent"}, {"start": 71.0, "text": "for ordering soup."}, {"start": 74.0, "text": "So, here's that inside of the"}, {"start": 75.0, "text": "Shortcuts Editor, where actions"}, {"start": 77.0, "text": "are configured."}, {"start": 79.0, "text": "Every action can have parameters"}, {"start": 81.0, "text": "that can be edited by the user."}, {"start": 83.0, "text": "And these parameters were"}, {"start": 84.0, "text": "defined inside of the Intent"}, {"start": 85.0, "text": "definition file."}, {"start": 87.0, "text": "Until the user enters a value,"}, {"start": 90.0, "text": "parameters show the display"}, {"start": 91.0, "text": "name."}, {"start": 92.0, "text": "And because this display name"}, {"start": 93.0, "text": "can sometimes be shown as a"}, {"start": 95.0, "text": "title in configuration UI, make"}, {"start": 97.0, "text": "sure that the display name is"}, {"start": 99.0, "text": "always capitalized."}, {"start": 101.0, "text": "The parameter summary is a"}, {"start": 103.0, "text": "sentence that's shown to the"}, {"start": 104.0, "text": "user that describes what the"}, {"start": 106.0, "text": "shortcut will do when it's run."}, {"start": 108.0, "text": "Summaries should read like a"}, {"start": 109.0, "text": "sentence and start with a verb."}, {"start": 112.0, "text": "There's no need to write the"}, {"start": 113.0, "text": "name of your app in the summary"}, {"start": 115.0, "text": "because it will be displayed at"}, {"start": 116.0, "text": "the top of the action alongside"}, {"start": 118.0, "text": "your app's icon."}, {"start": 120.0, "text": "Try to keep the summary short"}, {"start": 122.0, "text": "and only include the parameters"}, {"start": 123.0, "text": "that must be filled out for the"}, {"start": 125.0, "text": "action to be functional."}, {"start": 127.0, "text": "And whichever parameters you"}, {"start": 128.0, "text": "don't include the summary will"}, {"start": 129.0, "text": "be displayed underneath Show"}, {"start": 131.0, "text": "More which the user can expand"}, {"start": 133.0, "text": "while editing to modify the"}, {"start": 134.0, "text": "values in the remaining"}, {"start": 135.0, "text": "parameters."}, {"start": 137.0, "text": "Parameter summaries are defined"}, {"start": 139.0, "text": "in the Shortcuts app section in"}, {"start": 140.0, "text": "the Intent editor Xcode."}, {"start": 143.0, "text": "Soup Chef has multiple different"}, {"start": 144.0, "text": "summaries."}, {"start": 145.0, "text": "One for ordering pickup and the"}, {"start": 147.0, "text": "other for ordering delivery."}, {"start": 149.0, "text": "So, as the user changes between"}, {"start": 151.0, "text": "pickup and delivery inside of"}, {"start": 152.0, "text": "the action, the parameter"}, {"start": 154.0, "text": "summary will update based on the"}, {"start": 156.0, "text": "different values that the user"}, {"start": 157.0, "text": "has entered."}, {"start": 160.0, "text": "So, your app knows best about"}, {"start": 163.0, "text": "what the user does and when."}, {"start": 165.0, "text": "So, we think the most relevant"}, {"start": 167.0, "text": "place to create shortcuts is"}, {"start": 168.0, "text": "right inside of your app."}, {"start": 170.0, "text": "Here we are inside of Soup Chef"}, {"start": 172.0, "text": "and someone just ordered some"}, {"start": 173.0, "text": "tomato soup with cheese."}, {"start": 175.0, "text": "And this is a great time to"}, {"start": 177.0, "text": "present an Add to Siri button"}, {"start": 178.0, "text": "because the user just performed"}, {"start": 179.0, "text": "an action that they're very"}, {"start": 181.0, "text": "likely to repeat."}, {"start": 183.0, "text": "So, to do that, Soup Chef placed"}, {"start": 184.0, "text": "the order information into an"}, {"start": 186.0, "text": "intent and then, placed the Add"}, {"start": 188.0, "text": "to Siri button into the UI."}, {"start": 191.0, "text": "When the user taps on that"}, {"start": 192.0, "text": "button, the app lets them create"}, {"start": 193.0, "text": "a shortcut by showing the Add to"}, {"start": 195.0, "text": "Siri View Controller."}, {"start": 196.0, "text": "The API to do this has not"}, {"start": 198.0, "text": "changed since iOS 12 but this"}, {"start": 200.0, "text": "year, we've expanded what users"}, {"start": 202.0, "text": "can do inside of the View"}, {"start": 203.0, "text": "Controller."}, {"start": 204.0, "text": "So, let's look at what's new."}, {"start": 207.0, "text": "First, and instead of having to"}, {"start": 208.0, "text": "say the phrase to save the"}, {"start": 210.0, "text": "shortcut, users can now just"}, {"start": 212.0, "text": "type it or use dictation."}, {"start": 213.0, "text": "Your app should be prefilling"}, {"start": 216.0, "text": "this value by setting the"}, {"start": 217.0, "text": "suggestedInvocationPhrase"}, {"start": 219.0, "text": "property of your intent."}, {"start": 221.0, "text": "Try to keep this phrase short"}, {"start": 222.0, "text": "and descriptive about the kind"}, {"start": 224.0, "text": "of action that the user just"}, {"start": 225.0, "text": "did."}, {"start": 226.0, "text": "And because the user will be"}, {"start": 227.0, "text": "able to say this to Siri, it"}, {"start": 229.0, "text": "should also be easy to speak and"}, {"start": 231.0, "text": "remember."}, {"start": 232.0, "text": "Underneath that is the Do"}, {"start": 235.0, "text": "section, which will show the"}, {"start": 236.0, "text": "user a preview of what this"}, {"start": 238.0, "text": "shortcut will do when it's run."}, {"start": 240.0, "text": "Make sure to put as much"}, {"start": 241.0, "text": "information as possible into the"}, {"start": 243.0, "text": "intent about what the user just"}, {"start": 244.0, "text": "did."}, {"start": 245.0, "text": "This will ensure that your app"}, {"start": 246.0, "text": "can order the soup again without"}, {"start": 248.0, "text": "having to ask too many follow-up"}, {"start": 250.0, "text": "questions."}, {"start": 251.0, "text": "And if you've made your intent"}, {"start": 254.0, "text": "configurable, the user can tap"}, {"start": 256.0, "text": "on this, customize the shortcut,"}, {"start": 257.0, "text": "and change the values that were"}, {"start": 258.0, "text": "prefilled by, by you."}, {"start": 261.0, "text": "And once the user is done, they"}, {"start": 263.0, "text": "will tap the Add to Siri button"}, {"start": 264.0, "text": "and return back to your app."}, {"start": 267.0, "text": "And later on, they can go into"}, {"start": 268.0, "text": "the Shortcuts app where they can"}, {"start": 269.0, "text": "view, edit, and run the shortcut"}, {"start": 271.0, "text": "that they've made."}, {"start": 272.0, "text": "So, now let's take a look at"}, {"start": 274.0, "text": "some places in the Shortcuts app"}, {"start": 275.0, "text": "where you can make your"}, {"start": 277.0, "text": "shortcuts discoverable, as well."}, {"start": 280.0, "text": "Many first-time users will start"}, {"start": 281.0, "text": "off in the right-most tab which"}, {"start": 283.0, "text": "is the Gallery."}, {"start": 284.0, "text": "Here is where we suggest"}, {"start": 285.0, "text": "prebuilt shortcuts."}, {"start": 288.0, "text": "In iOS 13, we added a new"}, {"start": 290.0, "text": "section to the Gallery and it"}, {"start": 291.0, "text": "has suggested shortcuts from the"}, {"start": 293.0, "text": "apps that are frequently used on"}, {"start": 294.0, "text": "your device."}, {"start": 296.0, "text": "Now, your app's suggested"}, {"start": 297.0, "text": "shortcuts have the possibility"}, {"start": 299.0, "text": "of being prominently featured in"}, {"start": 300.0, "text": "the Gallery depending on how"}, {"start": 302.0, "text": "frequently the user interacts"}, {"start": 303.0, "text": "with your app."}, {"start": 305.0, "text": "Your app can influence the"}, {"start": 306.0, "text": "suggestions that are displayed"}, {"start": 308.0, "text": "in the Gallery in two different"}, {"start": 309.0, "text": "ways."}, {"start": 311.0, "text": "First, you can explicitly set a"}, {"start": 312.0, "text": "list of suggested shortcuts and"}, {"start": 315.0, "text": "you can use the"}, {"start": 316.0, "text": "INVoiceShortcutCenter to do"}, {"start": 317.0, "text": "this."}, {"start": 318.0, "text": "You can update this as often as"}, {"start": 320.0, "text": "you'd like as you learn more"}, {"start": 321.0, "text": "about your user's habits and"}, {"start": 323.0, "text": "preferences."}, {"start": 325.0, "text": "And we also populate this list"}, {"start": 326.0, "text": "with recent or frequently used"}, {"start": 328.0, "text": "actions that the user has done"}, {"start": 330.0, "text": "inside of your app."}, {"start": 331.0, "text": "Now, how does the Shortcuts app"}, {"start": 332.0, "text": "know what the user does inside"}, {"start": 334.0, "text": "of your app?"}, {"start": 335.0, "text": "In previous years, we've"}, {"start": 336.0, "text": "introduced the concept of"}, {"start": 337.0, "text": "Donation."}, {"start": 339.0, "text": "Now, Donation allows you to tell"}, {"start": 341.0, "text": "the system about things that the"}, {"start": 342.0, "text": "user does so that the system can"}, {"start": 344.0, "text": "later suggest them at a relevant"}, {"start": 345.0, "text": "time."}, {"start": 347.0, "text": "You can create a, you can donate"}, {"start": 349.0, "text": "by creating an INInteraction and"}, {"start": 351.0, "text": "putting a filled out intent"}, {"start": 353.0, "text": "about what the user just did"}, {"start": 354.0, "text": "into there."}, {"start": 356.0, "text": "And then, later call the Donate"}, {"start": 357.0, "text": "method."}, {"start": 359.0, "text": "Not only does Donate allow your"}, {"start": 360.0, "text": "shortcuts to appear in the"}, {"start": 362.0, "text": "Gallery, but it also enables"}, {"start": 363.0, "text": "private on-device Siri"}, {"start": 365.0, "text": "suggestions in places like the"}, {"start": 367.0, "text": "Lock Screen or Spotlight Search."}, {"start": 370.0, "text": "If you'd like to know more"}, {"start": 371.0, "text": "information about how"}, {"start": 372.0, "text": "suggestions from Donations work"}, {"start": 374.0, "text": "across the system, I encourage"}, {"start": 376.0, "text": "that you watch our talks from"}, {"start": 377.0, "text": "WWDC 2018."}, {"start": 381.0, "text": "Now, another time that users"}, {"start": 382.0, "text": "might be creating and"}, {"start": 384.0, "text": "discovering your shortcuts is"}, {"start": 385.0, "text": "when building a new shortcut"}, {"start": 386.0, "text": "inside of the app."}, {"start": 388.0, "text": "You'll see all of the possible"}, {"start": 390.0, "text": "actions that can be added into"}, {"start": 392.0, "text": "the shortcut in the Shortcuts"}, {"start": 393.0, "text": "editor."}, {"start": 394.0, "text": "There's categories across the"}, {"start": 395.0, "text": "top which contain hundreds of"}, {"start": 397.0, "text": "built-in actions for things like"}, {"start": 399.0, "text": "playing media, adding reminders,"}, {"start": 401.0, "text": "and also scripting actions like"}, {"start": 403.0, "text": "Loops and If statements."}, {"start": 404.0, "text": "Next, is a list of suggested"}, {"start": 408.0, "text": "actions. And these suggestions are based"}, {"start": 410.0, "text": "also on device usage which"}, {"start": 412.0, "text": "includes actions from"}, {"start": 413.0, "text": "third-party apps."}, {"start": 415.0, "text": "Since I order soup a lot, Soup"}, {"start": 416.0, "text": "Chef's action is right here at"}, {"start": 418.0, "text": "the top."}, {"start": 420.0, "text": "So, how did Soup Chef get all of"}, {"start": 421.0, "text": "these soup options to show up?"}, {"start": 423.0, "text": "Well, there were two easy steps"}, {"start": 425.0, "text": "to get this to work."}, {"start": 427.0, "text": "The first thing is to select"}, {"start": 428.0, "text": "which of the parameters is the"}, {"start": 430.0, "text": "key parameter."}, {"start": 432.0, "text": "Your key parameter should be the"}, {"start": 433.0, "text": "one that's most identifiable to"}, {"start": 435.0, "text": "the user."}, {"start": 436.0, "text": "And Soup Chef picked the soup"}, {"start": 437.0, "text": "type as the parameter because"}, {"start": 439.0, "text": "that's the most useful to the"}, {"start": 440.0, "text": "user, more than quantity or"}, {"start": 442.0, "text": "toppings."}, {"start": 444.0, "text": "And the second step is to Donate"}, {"start": 446.0, "text": "every time the user performs"}, {"start": 447.0, "text": "that action inside of your app,"}, {"start": 450.0, "text": "if you're already donating via"}, {"start": 452.0, "text": "the INVoiceShortcutCenter or via"}, {"start": 454.0, "text": "INInteraction, then there's no"}, {"start": 456.0, "text": "additional work required by your"}, {"start": 457.0, "text": "app."}, {"start": 458.0, "text": "As long as your donation has a"}, {"start": 459.0, "text": "value set for that key"}, {"start": 461.0, "text": "parameter, we can show it inside"}, {"start": 463.0, "text": "of suggestions."}, {"start": 465.0, "text": "Also, don't forget to include an"}, {"start": 467.0, "text": "image for your key parameter"}, {"start": 468.0, "text": "when donating."}, {"start": 469.0, "text": "If you don't provide an image,"}, {"start": 471.0, "text": "then your app's icon will be"}, {"start": 472.0, "text": "displayed in the list, instead."}, {"start": 474.0, "text": "And additionally, if you're"}, {"start": 476.0, "text": "looking for a list of all of the"}, {"start": 477.0, "text": "actions from your app that's"}, {"start": 479.0, "text": "donated or not, you can tap on"}, {"start": 481.0, "text": "the app's section to see them"}, {"start": 483.0, "text": "all."}, {"start": 484.0, "text": "Now, let's switch gears and"}, {"start": 486.0, "text": "build a shortcut with a set of"}, {"start": 487.0, "text": "actions that work great together"}, {"start": 489.0, "text": "by using input and output."}, {"start": 492.0, "text": "I have another app called"}, {"start": 493.0, "text": "StickyNote."}, {"start": 494.0, "text": "And StickyNote's a notetaking"}, {"start": 496.0, "text": "app where I write down things"}, {"start": 497.0, "text": "that I need to do."}, {"start": 499.0, "text": "StickyNote has a whole bunch of"}, {"start": 501.0, "text": "actions."}, {"start": 502.0, "text": "And most importantly, it has an"}, {"start": 503.0, "text": "action where I can search for"}, {"start": 504.0, "text": "notes by name."}, {"start": 506.0, "text": "And then, once a note is found,"}, {"start": 508.0, "text": "there are other actions that can"}, {"start": 509.0, "text": "manipulate that note such as"}, {"start": 512.0, "text": "inserting text into the note or"}, {"start": 513.0, "text": "deleting it."}, {"start": 515.0, "text": "In iOS 13, we now allow actions"}, {"start": 518.0, "text": "from your apps to output"}, {"start": 520.0, "text": "information for others to use."}, {"start": 522.0, "text": "So, the Find StickyNote action"}, {"start": 523.0, "text": "can output a StickyNote with an"}, {"start": 526.0, "text": "identifier, name, content, and"}, {"start": 528.0, "text": "the last date that it was"}, {"start": 529.0, "text": "modified."}, {"start": 530.0, "text": "I want to be able to chain two"}, {"start": 533.0, "text": "shortcuts together and find a"}, {"start": 535.0, "text": "note and then, add information"}, {"start": 537.0, "text": "into that note."}, {"start": 538.0, "text": "So, the note would be the output"}, {"start": 540.0, "text": "of the first action and I'm"}, {"start": 541.0, "text": "passing it as input to the"}, {"start": 543.0, "text": "second."}, {"start": 545.0, "text": "So, let's take a look at how to"}, {"start": 546.0, "text": "set up your action to produce"}, {"start": 547.0, "text": "output."}, {"start": 551.0, "text": "First, we'll click on the plus"}, {"start": 552.0, "text": "button at the bottom left to add"}, {"start": 554.0, "text": "a new type representing what a"}, {"start": 555.0, "text": "StickyNote is."}, {"start": 558.0, "text": "Types already have an identifier"}, {"start": 559.0, "text": "and the Display Name."}, {"start": 561.0, "text": "But the note has content and a"}, {"start": 563.0, "text": "date that it was last modified."}, {"start": 564.0, "text": "So, we'll add those as"}, {"start": 565.0, "text": "properties so the user can"}, {"start": 567.0, "text": "access all of that information."}, {"start": 570.0, "text": "Next, we'll select the response."}, {"start": 572.0, "text": "And the response is the object"}, {"start": 574.0, "text": "representing the result of the"}, {"start": 575.0, "text": "intent. We will add a note property,"}, {"start": 579.0, "text": "selecting the new type that we"}, {"start": 580.0, "text": "just made."}, {"start": 582.0, "text": "And finally, we'll select that"}, {"start": 583.0, "text": "property from the Output"}, {"start": 585.0, "text": "dropdown."}, {"start": 586.0, "text": "So, if your response has"}, {"start": 587.0, "text": "multiple properties, you need to"}, {"start": 589.0, "text": "pick a single one from that"}, {"start": 591.0, "text": "Output dropdown."}, {"start": 592.0, "text": "And this lets you control what"}, {"start": 593.0, "text": "information other actions can"}, {"start": 595.0, "text": "see."}, {"start": 596.0, "text": "So, now that our action has"}, {"start": 598.0, "text": "output, I can add one action and"}, {"start": 601.0, "text": "after the other and select the"}, {"start": 603.0, "text": "found note as the note that I"}, {"start": 604.0, "text": "want to add text to."}, {"start": 607.0, "text": "But for actions to work really"}, {"start": 608.0, "text": "great together, it would be nice"}, {"start": 610.0, "text": "if the note could automatically"}, {"start": 611.0, "text": "be filled in to the second"}, {"start": 613.0, "text": "action, so I don't have to"}, {"start": 614.0, "text": "select it from the first every"}, {"start": 616.0, "text": "single time."}, {"start": 617.0, "text": "So, if you need your actions to"}, {"start": 620.0, "text": "work great together and fill"}, {"start": 621.0, "text": "output from one into the input"}, {"start": 623.0, "text": "of another, you need to select"}, {"start": 625.0, "text": "one of your parameters as the"}, {"start": 626.0, "text": "input parameter."}, {"start": 627.0, "text": "Here we are looking at that Add"}, {"start": 629.0, "text": "Text to Note action."}, {"start": 631.0, "text": "And we'll select the note as the"}, {"start": 633.0, "text": "input parameter."}, {"start": 635.0, "text": "So, now when I add the second"}, {"start": 637.0, "text": "action, the Add Text to Note"}, {"start": 638.0, "text": "action, that note is already"}, {"start": 640.0, "text": "filled in to the note parameter"}, {"start": 642.0, "text": "from the first action."}, {"start": 644.0, "text": "So, adding inputs and outputs"}, {"start": 645.0, "text": "allows users to create multiple"}, {"start": 647.0, "text": "step shortcuts using your"}, {"start": 648.0, "text": "actions that work great"}, {"start": 650.0, "text": "together."}, {"start": 652.0, "text": "So, let's take a look at the"}, {"start": 653.0, "text": "things that we covered today."}, {"start": 655.0, "text": "First, we walked through the"}, {"start": 656.0, "text": "components of a Shortcuts action"}, {"start": 658.0, "text": "and how users can configure one."}, {"start": 661.0, "text": "Next, we looked at the various"}, {"start": 662.0, "text": "ways that users can discover"}, {"start": 665.0, "text": "your actions. And we started inside of your"}, {"start": 667.0, "text": "app using the Add to Siri"}, {"start": 669.0, "text": "experience."}, {"start": 670.0, "text": "And next, we walked through the"}, {"start": 672.0, "text": "Gallery and the Editor inside of"}, {"start": 673.0, "text": "the Shortcuts app and talked"}, {"start": 674.0, "text": "about how to make your actions"}, {"start": 676.0, "text": "discoverable there, as well."}, {"start": 678.0, "text": "And finally, we explored how to"}, {"start": 680.0, "text": "make your actions work great"}, {"start": 681.0, "text": "together taking input and"}, {"start": 683.0, "text": "produce output."}, {"start": 684.0, "text": "The Soup Chef app is available"}, {"start": 686.0, "text": "as sample code."}, {"start": 687.0, "text": "So, be sure to check that out if"}, {"start": 688.0, "text": "you want to see more about how"}, {"start": 689.0, "text": "all of this works."}, {"start": 691.0, "text": "We also had a session earlier"}, {"start": 693.0, "text": "this week where we covered more"}, {"start": 694.0, "text": "about how these can be used to"}, {"start": 696.0, "text": "power follow-up questions in"}, {"start": 698.0, "text": "Siri."}]}